    "title": "Cloudy and cooler overnight, few showers - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jeff Lyons ,\n11 hours ago EVANSVILLE, Ind. (WFIE) -A half-dozen severe thunderstorm warnings were issued Thursday evening across Wayne, Edwards and Wabash Counties, but no damage or severe weather was reported. Temps will fall into the lower 60s overnight as the cold front approaches. Rain chances will wind down early Friday with slow clearing and mid 50s through the day. Read full article\n31",
